The Lives and Opinions of Eminent Philosophers (@greek-source-diogenes: 0, is #book, #part-of @greek-sources) { r_2MZ8K8NBGJSS2844MJ7DDGR849
Diogenes Laertius; translated by Charles Duke Yonge. Historical English translation originally published in 1853.

[Retained EPUB](../books/diogenes-lives-and-opinions.epub) · [Original book and publication notices](https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/57342). English. Project Gutenberg identifies this edition as public domain in the USA; its notices and production credits remain in the retained file.

Used passages: Book X, the letter to Menoeceus, letters on nature, and concluding maxims; Book IX, the life of Pyrrho and its account of scepticism; Book VII for the optional comparison with Stoic accounts of knowledge. Distinguish preserved letters, reported arguments, anecdotes, and the transmitting author's organisation. [Epicurus guide](../schools/Epicurus.lingua#r_6KHZKEFRKY1J18Z7TSRAJABZQP) and [sceptics guide](../schools/Sceptics.lingua#r_6KEA1AHWJRDT3ZN8VJQTK06ZFK).

